"""_engine/score.py — SFX bus from the composition's own cue list.
   Run from the reel folder after `node engine/render.js --cues`:
     python3 engine/score.py [--palette motion|faceless|triplex|zoomplex|infograph|canvas|speaker|literal|gold|icon|archive|apple|apple-speaker|limbo|goz|board] [--gaps]
   Reads work/cues.json (written by render.js from window.CUES) and builds
   work/_sfx.wav. The schedule is never typed by hand: the same objects that
   draw the frame emit the cues.

   Laws: no impact on a zoom seam (motion); holes > 0.55 s filled with dry
   ticks every 0.30 s at half level; library folders 06_game / 07_cartoon are
   never used; two impacts per reel at most, on script turns only."""
